        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LexiLoong is a turn-based tabletop card simulation game that blends entertainment with education. Each card is uniquely named after the initial letter and length of an English word, such as &quot;A5&quot; for the word &quot;Apple.&quot; The core gameplay revolves around matching either the letter or number from the previous card played. Building on this foundation, LexiLoong offers the following distinctive features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​<strong>Special Cards</strong>: Includes magic cards, penalty cards, wild cards, and dragon cards to diversify gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​<strong>Spelling Challenge Cards</strong>: Seamlessly integrates educational elements into the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​<strong>Voice-Activated Play (Requires Microphone)​</strong>: Players trigger card plays by reading the word aloud and earn in-game coins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​<strong>Scenario-Based Level Design</strong>: Stages are categorized by real-world English word usage contexts.</p></li></ul>",
